# Default model choice
#
# This is the default MODEL_NAME consumed by profiles and scripts. It must be
# configurable rather than hard-coded into client logic (docs/04 §11).
# Individual backend profiles (profiles/*.env) may override it when the
# backend exposes a different model name (e.g. Ollama's short tags).
MODEL_NAME=Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B
